  "body": "Enjoy effortless, low-maintenance living in Amaia Takapuna, a modern apartment development perfectly positioned to make the most of everything the North Shore has to offer.\r\n\r\nThis spacious 74sqm, 2-bedroom apartment combines contemporary design with practical living, featuring an open-plan kitchen and living area that flows seamlessly onto your private outdoor deck — perfect for your morning coffee, entertaining or simply enjoying some fresh air.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n2 bedrooms\r\n1 bathroom\r\n74sqm floor area\r\n15sqm private outdoor deck \r\n1 secure carpark\r\nModern, quality finishes\r\nLow-maintenance, lock-and-leave living\r\n\r\nJust moments from Takapuna Beach, cafés, restaurants, shopping and coastal walkways, while offering easy access to the motorway, public transport and Auckland CBD. \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a smart investment or a stylish base on the North Shore, 417/48 Esmonde Road is an opportunity worth viewing.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\nBen - 021 196 3206\r\nNasir - 021 503 323",
